{"id":262,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自立と共生を育てる愛媛大附属中","feature_description":"校訓と教育目標で、自立と共生の力をもつ生徒の育成を掲げ、真理を求める探究や挑戦する力を重視しています。学校紹介ページでも校訓、目指す生徒像、日課、部活動の導線が整っており、学校生活の実像を追いやすい構成です。研究と実践を担う附属校としての性格も明確です。学校紹介、学校生活、部活動の導線が整理され、比較しやすい構成です。","clubs":[{"id":6275,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ncsaas.cu-mo.jp/ehime/htdocs/introduce/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6276,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ncsaas.cu-mo.jp/ehime/htdocs/introduce/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6277,"name":"男子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ncsaas.cu-mo.jp/ehime/htdocs/introduce/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6278,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ncsaas.cu-mo.jp/ehime/htdocs/introduce/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6279,"name":"男子ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ncsaas.cu-mo.jp/ehime/htdocs/introduce/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6280,"name":"女子ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ncsaas.cu-mo.jp/ehime/htdocs/introduce/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6281,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ncsaas.cu-mo.jp/ehime/htdocs/introduce/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6282,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ncsaas.cu-mo.jp/ehime/htdocs/introduce/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6283,"name":"男子陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ncsaas.cu-mo.jp/ehime/htdocs/introduce/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6284,"name":"女子陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ncsaas.cu-mo.jp/ehime/htdocs/introduce/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6285,"name":"駅伝部","category":"運動部","source_